{"ticker":"CVX","updated":"2026-10-23T22:50:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Chevron Corporation","shortName":"Chevron Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Integrated","country":"United States","website":"https://www.chevron.com","fullTimeEmployees":43039,"marketCap":457465528320,"trailingPE":22.445621,"forwardPE":14.838952,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.1848161,"pegRatio":0.98,"targetMeanPrice":230.66667,"targetHighPrice":253.0,"targetLowPrice":175.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.535,"earningsGrowth":3.219,"grossMargins":0.44267,"operatingMargins":0.21866,"profitMargins":0.09834,"totalRevenue":209383997440,"beta":0.523,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":233.74,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":146.49,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.14},"summary":"Chevron Corporation, through its subsidiaries, engages in the integrated energy and chemicals operations. It operates through Upstream and Downstream segments. The Upstream segment engages in the exploration for, development, production, and transportation of crude oil and natural gas; processing, liquefaction, transportation, and regasification of liquefied natural gas; transportation of crude oil through pipelines; transportation, storage, and marketing of natural gas; carbon capture and storage; and operation of a gas-to-liquids plant. The Downstream segment refines crude oil into petroleum products; markets crude oil, refined products, and lubricants; manufactures and markets renewable fuels; transports crude oil and refined products through pipeline, marine vessel, motor equipment, and rail car; and manufactures and markets commodity petrochemicals, plastics for industrial uses, and fuel and lubricant additives. The company operates in North America, South America, Europe, Africa, Asia, and Australia. The company was formerly known as ChevronTexaco Corporation and changed its name to Chevron Corporation in May 2005. Chevron Corporation was founded in 1879 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"雪佛龍公司透過其子公司從事綜合能源和化學品業務。它透過上游和下游部門運作。上游部門從事原油和天然氣的勘探、開發、生產和運輸；液化天然氣的處理、液化、運輸和再氣化；透過管道運輸原油；天然氣的運輸、儲存和行銷；碳捕獲和儲存；以及天然氣液化工廠的運作。下游部門將原油精煉成石油產品；銷售原油、成品油和潤滑油；製造和銷售再生燃料；透過管道、船舶、機動設備和軌道車運輸原油和成品油；生產和銷售商品石化產品、工業用塑膠以及燃料和潤滑油添加劑。該公司在北美、南美、歐洲、非洲、亞洲和澳洲開展業務。公司前身為雪佛龍德士古公司，2005年5月更名為雪佛龍公司。雪佛龍公司成立於1879年，總部位於德州休士頓。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"油氣一體化","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":157.9,"h":158.32,"l":157.17,"c":158.2,"v":7030000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":157.51,"h":160.0,"l":156.55,"c":157.36,"v":10270000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":157.4,"h":159.99,"l":157.21,"c":159.24,"v":7483000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":159.01,"h":159.52,"l":157.85,"c":159.32,"v":6502000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":159.7,"h":161.1,"l":159.45,"c":160.6,"v":6934800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":160.48,"h":161.86,"l":159.38,"c":161.83,"v":8947300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":160.0,"h":161.85,"l":157.02,"c":158.06,"v":9556100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":158.06,"h":159.65,"l":157.5,"c":157.69,"v":7243000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":156.06,"h":156.72,"l":153.49,"c":153.66,"v":11011700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":153.91,"h":155.03,"l":152.88,"c":154.0,"v":9462000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":154.91,"h":156.99,"l":154.6,"c":154.85,"v":7769200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":155.05,"h":157.92,"l":155.0,"c":157.79,"v":7440800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":156.5,"h":158.92,"l":156.01,"c":158.25,"v":6417400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":158.85,"h":159.78,"l":157.1,"c":157.11,"v":5546300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":157.38,"h":158.32,"l":156.5,"c":157.31,"v":5030500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":158.25,"h":160.1,"l":158.12,"c":159.54,"v":8011000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":159.2,"h":160.67,"l":158.61,"c":160.09,"v":5736800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":160.03,"h":160.29,"l":158.09,"c":158.84,"v":6244200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":159.0,"h":159.0,"l":155.55,"c":156.21,"v":16734000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":155.62,"h":157.12,"l":155.15,"c":156.05,"v":5244000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":157.12,"h":159.83,"l":156.99,"c":157.42,"v":7181400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":158.32,"h":160.